        {
          "start": 1942,
          "end": 3341,
          "old": "",
          "new": "          <h2>Optional Poker Foundations progress</h2>\n          <p>The <a href=\"/poker/study/#course-progress\">Poker Study desk</a> lets you mark six lessons and choose a next reading or practice task. Those choices remain in the open page unless you choose to remember them on this device. That option uses one entry in your browser's local storage. It contains the lesson marks you choose, your next task, and the course and file-format versions. It contains no names, written answers, hand histories, scores, or record of the pages you visit.</p>\n          <p>The progress tool does not send these choices to this website, analytics, or another service. You can stop remembering them or reset the record from the same controls. Other people using the same browser profile on this device may be able to see it. Browser clearing, private browsing, or storage limits may remove it, so keep an exported copy if the record matters to you.</p>\n          <p>Exporting downloads a small progress file. Importing a file reads it in the current page and shows a preview before replacing your choices; it does not upload the file or enable device saving. Manual copy and paste use the complete progress text shown in the tool. Your browser and any app you use to keep or share a copy have their own data handling. Ordinary pageview analytics still operates as described above, without progress events.</p>\n"
        }
      ]
    },
